-serif;color:#1F3864\">Alex Example</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F3864\">Associate</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F3864\">Your Company</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F3864\">Your Company Tagline Here</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F3864\">M (555) 010-0102</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F3864\"><a href=\"mailto:alex@yourcompany.com\"><span style=\"color:#0563C1\">alex@yourcompany.com</span></a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Fiona Calder &lt;fiona.calder@haldenpryce.example&gt; <br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, November 6, 2026 4:58 AM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Alex Example &lt;alex@yourcompany.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> Cross-border facilities<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Pat,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Many thanks for your time yesterday. As discussed, we arrange cross-border facilities for UK corporates acquiring US assets and would welcome the chance to work together on the next transaction.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Kind regards<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></